## [Items](items)

### [a votive plate](clue_votive)
---
Type: item/quest
Art: unknown
---
Not a machine part. A plate, cut with a copy of the giants' notation by somebody who did
not understand it - the work of people who found a working Beacon relay, built a shrine
around what they thought it was, and wrote down where the real one had gone.

### [shrine metal](choir_salvage)
---
Type: item/salvage
Art: unknown
Price: 140
---
Soft alloy, beaten thin, a thousand offerings' worth. Worth something to Eddy and nothing
to anyone else.

## [Relics](relics)

### [The False Choir](false_choir)
---
Atmosphere: blue
Containment: tractor
Scrape band: 140
Margin: 80
Forbid jump: yes
Seed: 96
Art: plain_asteroid_7, plain_asteroid_10, plain_asteroid_11
